TRIAL_SET = N4 ts_N4_J170_D_S_z9sym_v1.json:ea9d6c1bc72cdac5b6d55091766a908937c7ce2bf60257636824388ffe5b7b5d, N3 ts_N3_S_z9sym_v1.json:a298db655d832c0685a9aba093dd123d372698fa2fb7905a15f442bb0e35f8e6 (psi-hat and the stored states 1, 3 of the S9 records per N; u_x and u_y lie along the canonical e1, e3: the stored-state coefficients are flipped where S[3][1] or S[1][3] is negative)
J_LO_CHECK = 300
T1 = 1/300
CLAIM = for N in {3, 4}, g in {psi, e1, e2, e3} (engine A's basis states on the trial set above; psi from vac_poly with the vacres q1..q3) and every t in (0, 1/J_LO_CHECK]: nu_g >= ||(B_g(t) - b0_g) 1_near||_t / t, the near-region part of |psi_g(t) - iota_t(b0_g)| / t in engine A's norm (the norm of nP: ||F||_t = (n1(t) E_G1(t)[F^2])^1/2, G1, n1 = tilted_cov_a(LD, BD, [c_m t] * 6) of kt_cert_v1_9, Wishart on column 1); the far part enters through far_out at |m_g(t)| + |delta_g| (BRIDGE). B_g(t) = E0 pS_g(xi; t) is the full chart function (no truncation: the series remainder is included), b0_g = pS_g(Q/2; 0), near = t X_v <= a_m at every vertex; TRI_p > 0 (C-TRI). Sign flips of the stored states leave nu_g unchanged.
BRIDGE = |Q_W(t) S e_k| <= [engine A bound with nP -> ||P - r0||_t and far_out at |m_g(t)| + |delta_g|] + t sum_g |delta_g| nu_g, the last term outside the square root (NU_G_NOTE_v1 sect. 3)
